      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://aboutstlouis.com/local/communities/pasadena-hills-missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A Tudor Revival gate, designed by T.P. Barnett Company, marks the Natural Bridge Road entrance and was built in 1929.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://aboutstlouis.com/local/communities/pasadena-hills-missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pasadena Hills streets curve through tree‑lined boulevards, feature sunken parks, and showcase landscaped front lawns in classic European styles.",
